# Database — {{.ProjectTitle}}

PostgreSQL 18, owned by the **API project**: its `migrations/` are the source of truth and only the API runs them
(`make migrate-up` there, against the local Docker database during development).

This worker mirrors the tables it needs in `src/models/*` (Drizzle). When the API migrates a table this worker uses,
update the mirror in the same change.

